On-device ONNX models
---------------------
The search binary downloads and embeds three ONNX models. Their sources,
revisions, licenses, and integrity hashes are recorded in:
  provenance/models.json

- bge-small-en-v1.5 (embeddings) — MIT
- ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 (reranker) — Apache-2.0
- DeBERTa-v3-base-mnli-fever-anli (NLI, build-time optional) — MIT

Rust dependencies
-----------------
The Rust binary's dependency graph is gated by native/deny.toml (license
allowlist + advisory + crates.io-only source checks). A full machine-readable
SBOM is published with each release; see provenance/ and the release assets.
